Before editing source, inspect the actual persisted workspace and run the application.

Inspect at least:

- `src/App.tsx`
- `src/components/TitleScreen.tsx`
- `src/components/GameHud.tsx`
- `src/components/StatusModal.tsx`
- `src/game/input.ts`
