- `src/game/types.ts`
- `src/game/config.ts`
- `src/game/renderer.ts`
- Relevant styles, components, assets, test files, and package scripts.

Examine the actual rendered screens, not just their JSX.

Audit the following states individually:

1. Title screen on a fresh launch.
2. Returning player with an active campaign, where supported.
3. Tactical brief and controls.
4. Opening transmission.
5. First playable Calibration Bay moment.
6. Initial movement/combat tutorial.
7. Echo recording and playback.
8. Each stage of the Calibration puzzle.
9. Chapter transitions.
10. Every boss encounter HUD.
11. Chapter selection and practice selection.
12. Pause menu and settings.
13. Boss defeat, player defeat, and retry.
14. Victory summary and Chronicle Loom choices.
